      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your restaurant will be excellent.' Offering a compliment, the official gives a glowing review of the establishment.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Мы все делаем правильно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We do everything right.' Elena responds proudly, asserting that they always handle their business properly.",
