      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Вы меня очень удивили.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You really surprised me.' Admitting his shock, the official says he did not expect such a flawless operation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Ни одного повара без документов.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not a single cook without documents.' Highlighting the perfection, he points out that every single worker had their paperwork in order.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Я привыкла работать по закону.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I got used to working by the law.' Stating her principles, the owner mentions that following the rules is just how she operates.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Мне было очень приятно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It was very pleasant for me.' Wrapping up the visit, the official remarks on how enjoyable the experience was.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Пойдём в другой ресторан?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us go to another restaurant?' Suggesting a new target, he proposes they move on to the next place.",
